{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026RAKrNMDBIg1794453946.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>商人潘焯鴻被控兩項普通襲擊罪，在九龍城裁判法院開審。</p><p></p><p>潘焯鴻被控去年7月，在九龍城廣場一間店舖前襲擊一男一女，被告否認控罪。控方指案件有5名證人，包括兩名事主、商場經理及警員等，預料審訊兩天。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T04:24:06.712956+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":96,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T03:07:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T02:17:11.656710+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T04:17:14.331468+00:00","content_hash":"8b52aa9d607a6232f8c1c63e29f7cf997ef85f72384fc62eee51d4fb2ac9481e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-12T04:24:06.712956+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}